cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "civic-publish-kit: City update rehearsal"
repository-code: "https://github.com/parallexlabs/civic-publish-kit"
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: "ParalleX Labs Inc."
abstract: >-
  A public-data rehearsal of a reviewable update cycle for the City of Surrey Development Applications layer:
  read-only extraction with recorded provenance, EPSG:26910 to WGS84 normalization, plain-language validation
  reports, immutable local packages with acknowledged diffs, and local rollback. City GIS publishes reviewed files
  through its own ArcGIS Online; the software makes no remote writes.
keywords:
  - open data
  - provenance
  - geojson
  - arcgis
  - civic
